  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-starry-stage-v2.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "284e9e9532e894fdaae3259eec16dbdf2b2194a900956c3487dfd7bd80f63355",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b0986be438441e48414effebfe5d289da3f593915cc7dc9c9ee365db9ad56d7d",
      "text": "Wukong’s\nStarry Stage",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "aede307aa82b1392620584111e42893f0c6a8ad6fcaeda6726a7c56f2fd67cdd",
      "text": "Tonight is story night!\nWukong builds a little stage.\nA blue curtain hangs at\nthe back.\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2905c82856079a442c35e2d9fe1fa7b6ba666c370e694a7ba0c0cc9b25d712f7",
      "text": "Wukong sticks paper stars on\nthe curtain.\nOne, two, three, four,\nfive, six.\nSix stars shine on the stage.\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "35333d1259a21c6f753b1e6cefc18229e7cfc42ba88b58d2ba50a8119260a397",
      "text": "Rabbit hops in with two\nmore stars.\n“Can I add these?” she asks.\n“Yes, please!” says Wukong.\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "903cd644d3b487f00705cd791370cedd5758ddc7f085649f60398c9f2890bd34",
      "text": "Rabbit adds two stars to\nthe curtain.\nSix and two more make eight.\n“Eight stars altogether!”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "91a7e20ed5928d284f4d559a45be6e267b8c49e60c724ba0ee582218a0581e2a",
      "text": "Pigsy comes with\nthe storybook.\nHe stops at the entrance.\nThere is only a plain\nlittle sign.\n“Is story night in here?”\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4edf26ab56c7933e97234e9f32a121a81f9c68cd6829fa00a216066a1c410b01",
      "text": "“The entrance needs stars\ntoo,” says Rabbit.\n“But we have no more stars,”\nsays Wukong.\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9fa30ebe39f4071b01df085dc99e4e9d6dabac63fca545ee97c870975efd0d33",
      "text": "Wukong has an idea.\n“Let’s take away three stars\nfrom the curtain.”\nOff come one, two, three!\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c140cde38f77aafa82a2cdff583713d806868abb7ea3e319275a4571bb328cc4",
      "text": "How many are left on\nthe curtain?\nOne, two, three, four, five.\nTake away three, and five\nare left.\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5a95b0da0ea3130778fbcbd5378d4e159e1aebbae0ec5b8761b164996f8a80ad",
      "text": "They stick three stars on the\nlittle sign.\nNow the entrance shines too!\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "78d28212d08bafc6744c3eaa8d1acf6587298108ab8187dfc8de84fdc4ec55c2",
      "text": "Pigsy looks worried.\n“Did we lose three stars?”\n“No,” says Rabbit.\n“We moved them because the\nentrance needed some.”\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "63a392158a54ec44959c726a3082f3ff3a0adf9247207ba36a318fc91ecbec40",
      "text": "Wukong counts them all.\nFive left on the curtain.\nThree at the entrance.\n“Still eight stars altogether!”\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8b9be36a214e4e528b3343e14d22a5324623b928a7ac473bf9804850b0b6ef60",
      "text": "Pigsy pats his round tummy.\n“Can my tummy be the moon?”\nEveryone laughs.\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "81904003b9b702a93a3be9f37101584d166a0aa7a04e82f700ef9cdbaccc04a8",
      "text": "“A moon is not a star,”\nsays Wukong.\n“So we still have eight stars.”\n“And one tummy moon!”\nsays Rabbit.\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ee6ff488fed599d4769b51c067c700bc7a56abe86bb1727baea5f943ad37b13e",
      "text": "The stage is ready.\nRabbit and Wukong sit on\nsoft cushions.\nPigsy opens the book.\n“Once upon a time…”\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b80dc050bf21e0f468c328ac7937cf53f4b7237a84f205477c60e9f7bcbbed37",
      "text": "When the story ends,\nWukong looks up.\nReal stars twinkle in the sky.\n“More stars!” he whispers.\nToo many to count!\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
